        <mxCell id="behavior" parent="1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#253448;spacing=0;" value="Cancellation behavior&#xa;• cancel(false): marks cancelled and interrupts registered blocking waiters.&#xa;• cancel(true): additionally requests interrupts for tracked running tasks.&#xa;• Nested runs keep an outer link to preserve outstanding interrupt requests.&#xa;• A Generator links to a parent via Listener and releases its Registration on end, cancel, or close." vertex="1">
